    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n    <div class=\"col-8\">\r\n   <p>The admittance is defined as the ratio of phasor current to phasor voltage or the inverse of impedance.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$Y = \\dfrac{I}{V} = \\dfrac{1}{Z} = G+jB$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 362</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/75/AC_RLC_parallel_circuit.svg\" style=\"width:340px;\"></p><br/><small><small>\r\n<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:AC_RLC_parallel_circuit.svg\">P1ayer</a>, CC0, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
