    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n    <div class=\"col-8\">\r\n   Energy stored in a capacitor\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$E = \\dfrac{CV_c^2}{2} = \\dfrac{q_c^2}{2C} = \\dfrac{q_cv_c}{2}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 360</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\nEnergy stored in an inductor\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$E = \\dfrac{Li_l^2}{2}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 360</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c2/Capacitor_energy_change.png\" style=\"width:340px;\"></p>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Capacitor_energy_change.png\">DMGualtieri</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0\">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
    "important": "\\[E = \\dfrac{CV_c^2}{2} = \\dfrac{q_c^2}{2C} = \\dfrac{q_cv_c}{2}\\]",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1io21qu8zcrL-ZgcmPbzJtu3McWVOBHeW/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-blue-200 transition-colors\">📄 Homework</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iQdfUddOAi9QF2aLQIShf3iqpAVLKrQA/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/40 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\">✅ Solution</a></div>",
