    "content_html": "<h5><span><b>Slip:</b></span></h5>\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\mathrm{slip} = \\dfrac{n_s - n}{n_s}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 368</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\nwhere, <br/>\r\nn$_s$ = synchronous speed (rpm)<br/>\r\nn = speed of the rotor (rpm)",
