    "discipline": "Other",
    "subject": "Electricity and Magnetism",
    "chapter": "Motors and Generators",
    "topic": "Efficiency, Losses and Power in Rotating Machines",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "Efficiency of a rotating machine\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\eta = \\dfrac{P_{out}}{P_{in}}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 367</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$P_{out} = P_{in} – \\mathrm{losses}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 367</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\nMechanical power of a rotating machine \r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$P = T \\omega$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 367</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
