    "discipline": "Other",
    "subject": "Engineering Economics",
    "chapter": "Depreciation",
    "topic": "Straight Line Depreciation",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n  <div class=\"row align-items-start\">\n    <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\n      <h5><span><b>Straight Line Depreciation Method:</b></span></h5>\n      <p><b>Straight line method</b> depreciates the cost of a capital asset evenly and uniformly throughout its useful economic life. It is the simplest and most widely used non-tax method of calculating depreciation.</p>\n\n      <p><span class=\"math display\">\\[\\mathrm{Depreciation \\ per\\ annum = \\dfrac{Cost - Salvage\\ Value}{Useful \\ Life}}\\]</span></p>\n\n      <div class=\"text-center my-3\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg px-4 py-2 border rounded-xl font-mono text-sm\">$D_{j} = \\dfrac{C - S_{n}}{n}$ <span class=\"text-muted ml-4\">&emsp; NCEES Handbook p. 231</span></button>\n      </div>\n\n      <p><b>Notation:</b></p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>$D_j$ = Depreciation charge in year $j$ ($j = 1, 2, \\dots, n$)</li>\n        <li>$C$ = Initial cost of purchase (basis)</li>\n        <li>$S_n$ = Expected salvage (residual) value at end of useful life</li>\n        <li>$n$ = Recovery period / useful economic life in years</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h5><span><b>Book Value (\\(\\mathrm{BV}\\)):</b></span></h5>\n      <p>The <b>Book Value</b> of an asset at the end of year $j$ represents the initial cost less accumulated depreciation:</p>\n      <div class=\"text-center my-3\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg px-4 py-2 border rounded-xl font-mono text-sm\">$\\mathrm{BV}_j = C - \\sum_{i=1}^j D_i = C - j \\cdot D_j$ <span class=\"text-muted ml-4\">&emsp; NCEES Handbook p. 231</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <p>At the end of useful life ($j = n$), the book value equals the salvage value ($\\mathrm{BV}_n = S_n$).</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col col-lg-4 text-center\">\n      <p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/Depreciation_car.svg\" alt=\"Depreciation Car Illustration\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px;\"></p>\n      <small class=\"text-muted block mt-1\"><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Depreciation_car.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">João Pimentel Ferreira</a>, CC BY-SA 3.0</small>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "important": "\\[D_j = \\dfrac{C - S_n}{n}\\]\r\n\r\n\\[\\mathrm{BV}_j = C - j \\cdot D_j\\]\r\n\r\n\\[\\mathrm{BV}_n = S_n\\]",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><!-- <div class=\"w-full mt-2\"><div style=\"padding:59.41% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/586142968?badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479&amp;h=cf9506ffd4\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" title=\"Depreciation Methods\"></iframe></div><script src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\"></script></div> --></div>",
    "images": [
      "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/Depreciation_car.svg"
    ],
    "local_images": [],
    "video": "assets/videos/Straight_Line_Depreciation_Method.mp4",
    "videoTitle": "Straight Line Depreciation Method"
