    "content_html": "<div class=\"notes-image-container my-4 text-center flex flex-col items-center\"><center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/Vapor_pressure.svg\" alt=\"Vapor pressure\" width=\"340\"><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vapor_pressure.svg\">HellTchi</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0\">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/></div><p>The pressure at which a liquid will boil is called its vapor pressure.</p>",
