    "content_html": "<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\begin{align*} -F_x &= Q \\rho (v_2 \\cos \\alpha - v_1)\\\\ F_y &= Q \\rho (v_2 \\sin \\alpha - 0)\\end{align*}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 188</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
