    "content_html": "<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\begin{align*}\r\n-F_x &= Q \\rho (v_{2x} - v_{1x})\\\\\r\n&= - Q \\rho (v_1- v) (1- \\cos \\alpha)\r\n\\end{align*}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 189</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\begin{align*}\r\nF_y &= Q \\rho (v_{2y} - v_{1y})\\\\\r\n&= + Q \\rho (v_1- v) (\\sin \\alpha)\r\n\\end{align*}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 189</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
