    "content_html": "<div class=\"notes-image-container my-4 text-center flex flex-col items-center\"><center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cf/Trigonometric_identity_mnemonic.svg\" alt=\"Trigonometric identities\" width=\"340\"><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Trigonometric_identity_mnemonic.svg\">Mliu92</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/></div><div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\begin{align*}\r\n\\cos^2\\ \\theta +  \\sin^2\\ \\theta &= 1\\\\\r\n1 + \\tan^2\\ \\theta &= \\sec^2\\ \\theta\\\\\r\n1 + \\cot^2\\ \\theta &= \\csc^2\\ \\theta\\\\\r\n\\end{align*}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 38</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
