    "content_html": "<ol>\r\n<li>Type One - When a signal has to be delayed for a specified period of time</li>\r\n<li>Type Two - When an output has to be generated for the specified period of time</li>\r\n<li>Type Three - When after receiving an input signal, output a signal for the specified time, regardless of the duration of the input.</li>\r\n</ol>",
