    "discipline": "Other",
    "subject": "Probability and Statistics",
    "chapter": "Hypothesis Testing",
    "topic": "Confidence Intervals",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n\t<div class=\"row align-items-start\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n<p>A <b>Confidence Interval</b> is a specific interval estimate of a parameter determined by using data obtained from a sample and the specific confidence level of the estimate.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A <b>Confidence Level</b> of an interval estimate of a parameter is the probability that the interval estimate will contain the parameter.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5><span><b>Confidence Interval:</b></span></h5>\r\n\r\nPart A: When $\\sigma$ is known:\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$X - z_{\\frac{\\alpha}{2}} \\left(\\dfrac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{n}}\\right) < \\mu < X + z_{\\frac{\\alpha}{2}} \\left(\\dfrac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{n}}\\right)$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 74</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\nPart B: When $\\sigma$ is unknown:\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$X - t_{\\frac{\\alpha}{2}} \\left(\\dfrac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{n}}\\right) < \\mu < X + t_{\\frac{\\alpha}{2}} \\left(\\dfrac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{n}}\\right)$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 74</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\nwhere $t_{\\frac{\\alpha}{2}}$ corresponds to degree of freedom = n-1\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    \t\t<div class=\"col\">\r\n     <center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9f/Point_estimation_and_confidence_interval_estimation.png\" alt=\"Point estimation and confidence interval estimation\" width=\"340\"><br/>\r\n\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Point_estimation_and_confidence_interval_estimation.png\">Ruby00269, based on chart by Shishirdasika</a>, <br/>\r\n<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0\">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n    \t\t</div>\r\n  \t</div>\r\n</div>",
    "important": "",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1P3UddcmjjYejk5Zy_VsnaI6mcNbHQb30/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/40 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\">👨‍🏫 Tutoring</a></div>",
