    "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n   <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n   <p>In Permutations, order matters.</p>\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$P(n,r) = \\dfrac{n!}{(n-r)!}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 64</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\nIn Combinations, order does not matter.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$C(n,r) = \\dfrac{n!}{r!(n-r)!}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 64</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/Permutations_RGB.svg\" style=\"max-width: 50vh;\"></p><br/>\r\n\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Permutations_RGB.svg\">WatchduckYou can name the author as &quot;T. Piesk&quot;, &quot;Tilman Piesk&quot; or &quot;Watchduck&quot;.</a>, Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons<br/></small></small></center>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
