    "discipline": "Other",
    "subject": "Probability and Statistics",
    "chapter": "Probability Functions, Distributions, and Expected Values",
    "topic": "Binomial Distribution",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<p>The problems relating to tossing of coins or throwing of dice or drawing cards from a pack of cards with replacement lead to binomial probability distribution.<br />\r\nOnly two possibilities are in Binomial distribution.<br />\r\np = Probability of success<br />\r\nq = Probability of failure = 1- p .. ... .. .. .. Since only two outcomes, success and failure, are possible<br />\r\nn = no. of total attempts<br />\r\nx = no. of successful attempts = 0,1,2,3,.. .. .. ,n<br />\r\nThen probability of success P(x) is given by:</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$[P(x)= C(n,x)p^{x}q^{n-x} = \\dfrac{n!}{x!(n-x)!}p^{x}q^{n-x}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 66</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
    "important": "\\[P(x)= C(n,x)p^{x}q^{n-x} = \\dfrac{n!}{x!(n-x)!}p^{x}q^{n-x}\\]",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rjejkpzaRigrtkkK3VAMAztLS3crG1io/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-blue-200 transition-colors\">📄 Homework</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1h-74w9jTOJwg8CujUnkoS16_yimSzWNc/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/40 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\">✅ Solution</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LOOUIjtIUjjngnd9iT_ZWqga3jsyUe8i/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/40 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\">👨‍🏫 Tutoring</a><!-- <div class=\"w-full mt-2\"><div style=\"padding:56.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1003484364?badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" title=\"Binomial Distributions\"></iframe></div><script src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\"></script></div> --></div>",
