    "topic": "Linear Combinations",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n   <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n   If \\[Y = a_1 X_1 + a_2 X_2  +... +  a_n X_n\\] \r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$E(Y) = a_1 E(X_1) + a_2 E(X_2)  +... +  a_n E(X_n)$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 66</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$V(Y) = a_1^2 V(X_1) + a_2^2 V(X_2)  +... +  a_n^2 V(X_n)$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 66</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/Linear_combination_in_2D_space.png\" style=\"max-width: 50vh;\"></p><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Linear_combination_in_2D_space.png\">JozumBjada</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
