    "discipline": "Other",
    "subject": "Safety, Health, and Environment",
    "chapter": "Basic Safety Equipment",
    "topic": "Pressure-Relief Valves",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n\t<div class=\"row align-items-start\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n\r\n<h5><span><b>Function:</b></span></h5>\r\n<p>In case of a pressure build-up or an overpressure, a pressure relief\r\nvalve protect the system by venting out the excess pressure.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h5><span><b>Types:</b></span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><p>Spring Loaded Pressure Relief Valve</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Balanced Bellows Valves and Balanced Piston Valves</p></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h5><span><b>Terminology:</b></span></h5>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><p>Opening pressure</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Reseating pressure</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Lift</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Flow diameter</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Popping pressure</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Rated relieving capacity</p></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    \t\t<div class=\"col\">\r\n     <center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/Symbol_Pressure_relief_valve.svg\" alt=\"Symbol Pressure relief valve\" width=\"340\"><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Symbol_Pressure_relief_valve.svg\">MovGP0</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0\">CC BY 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n\r\n<center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/53/Relief_Valve.png\" alt=\"Relief Valve\" width=\"340\"><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Relief_Valve.png\">Mbeychok</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0\">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n    \t\t</div>\r\n  \t</div>\r\n</div>",
    "important": "",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><!-- <div class=\"w-full mt-2\"><div style=\"padding:56.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/830991846?h=04e9160f15&amp;badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" title=\"Pressure Relief Valve\"></iframe></div><script src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\"></script></div> --></div>",
