    "content_html": "<ol>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p>Point loads-concentrated forces exerted at point or location</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p>Distributed loads-a force applied along a length or over an area. The distribution can be uniform or non-uniform.</p>\r\n\r\n\t<ol>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<p>Uniformly distributed Load (UDL):</p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<p>Triangular Load:</p>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ol>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Common representations of loads:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Point Load</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. UDL</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Triangular Load</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
