    "content_html": "<div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n\t<div class=\"row align-items-start\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n\r\n<h5><span><b>Measuring Systems:</b></span></h5>\r\n\r\n<center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/Si_base_units-table_2-nist_sp_330-2019.jpg\" alt=\"SI Units\" width=\"720\"><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_base_units-table_2-nist_sp_330-2019.jpg\">United States government</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\nMKS = Meter, Kilogram and Second<br/>\r\nCGS = Centimeter, Gram and Second<br/>\r\nFPS = Foot, Pound and Second.<br/>\r\n<br/>\r\nSI System (System De Internationale) is very close to MKS system.\r\n\r\n<center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f5/Unit-conversions.svg\" alt=\"Unit conversions\" width=\"720\"><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Unit-conversions.svg\">Uranther</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0\">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    \t\t<div class=\"col\">\r\n     <center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c9/SI_Logo_with_defining_constants.png\" alt=\"SI Logo with defining constants\" width=\"340\"><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:SI_Logo_with_defining_constants.png\">Bureau international des poids et mesures, International Bureau of Weights and Measures (BIPM)</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/igo/deed.en\">CC BY-SA 3.0 IGO</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n\r\n<center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/CelsiusKelvin.svg\" alt=\"Celsius and Kelvin Scales\" width=\"340\"><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:CelsiusKelvin.svg\">Celsius_kelvin_estandar_1954.png: Homo logosderivative work: kismalac</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0\">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \t\t</div>\r\n  \t</div>\r\n</div>",
