    "content_html": "<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$(\\Delta H_r^\\circ) = \\displaystyle \\sum_{\\mathrm{products}} v_i (\\Delta H_f^\\circ)_i - \\displaystyle \\sum_{\\mathrm{reactants}} v_i (\\Delta H_f^\\circ)_i$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 152</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
