    "discipline": "Other",
    "subject": "Thermodynamics and Heat Transfer",
    "chapter": "Conduction",
    "topic": "Approximate Solution for Solid with Sudden Convection",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "For plane walls,\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$Fo = \\dfrac{\\alpha t}{L^2}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 207</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\nFor infinite cylinders and spheres,\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$Fo = \\dfrac{\\alpha t}{r_0^2}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 207</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\dfrac{T_0 - T_{\\infty}}{T_i - T_{\\infty}} = C_1 exp(-\\zeta_1^2 Fo)$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 207</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
    "important": "",
    "resources": "",
