    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n   <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n   <div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\dot{Q} = \\dfrac{2 \\pi kL (T_1-T_2)}{\\ln\\left(\\dfrac{r_2}{r_1}\\right)}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 205</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/Hollow_cylinder_with_convective_surface_conditions.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 50vh;\"></p><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hollow_cylinder_with_convective_surface_conditions.jpg\">DelPaine</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
