    "discipline": "Other",
    "subject": "Thermodynamics and Heat Transfer",
    "chapter": "Conduction",
    "topic": "Fourier's Law of Heat Conduction",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n\t<div class=\"row align-items-start\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n\r\n<p>Conduction expressed by Fourier’s law of heat conduction as written below:</p>\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\dot{Q} = - k A \\dfrac{dT}{dx}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 204</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n<p>Where, <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\displaystyle \\dfrac{dT}{dx}\\)</span> is the temperature gradient. k is the thermal conductivity A is the area which is normal to the direction of heat transfer.</p>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    \t\t<div class=\"col\">\r\n    <center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/Conduction_chaleur_barreau_echauffement.svg\" alt=\"Conduction\" width=\"340\"><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Conduction_chaleur_barreau_echauffement.svg\">Cdang</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0\">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center> <br/>\r\n    \t\t</div>\r\n  \t</div>\r\n</div>",
    "important": "\\[\\dot{Q}_{\\mathrm{conduction}} = - k A \\dfrac{dT}{dx}\\]",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><!-- <div class=\"w-full mt-2\"><div style=\"padding:56.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/829391944?h=47f6aebb11&amp;badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" title=\"Fourier&amp;#039;s Law of Heat Conduction\"></iframe></div><script src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\"></script></div> --></div>",
    "images": [],
    "local_images": [],
    "video": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZiqHdEVUQ8z_3KBRa3wBZvhL85RdGwxX/preview",
    "videoTitle": "Fourier's Law of Heat Conduction"
