    "discipline": "Other",
    "subject": "Thermodynamics and Heat Transfer",
    "chapter": "Conduction",
    "topic": "Lumped System Analysis",
    "subtopic": "Lumped System Calculations",
    "content_html": "Heat accepted by convection = Heat dissipated by conduction\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\dot{Q} = hA_s (T - T_{\\infty}) = - \\rho V C_p \\left(\\dfrac{dT}{dt}\\right)$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 206</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\nwhere,<br/>\r\n$\\rho$ = Density of the solid body<br/>\r\nT = Temperature<br/>\r\nt = time<br/>\r\nC$_P$ = Specific heat of the solid body \r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$(T - T_{\\infty}) = (T_i - T_{\\infty}) e^{-\\beta t}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 206</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
