    "content_html": "<div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n\t<div class=\"row align-items-start\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col col-lg-6\">\r\n\r\n<p>The Kirchhoff’s law of radiation states that the emissivity and the absorptivity of a surface are equal at the same temperature and wavelength.</p>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    \t\t<div class=\"col\">\r\n     <center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/Heat_Transfer.png\" alt=\"Heat Transfer\" width=\"500\"><br/>\r\n\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Heat_Transfer.png\">BruceBlaus</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n    \t\t</div>\r\n  \t</div>\r\n</div>",
